        <obo:IAO_0000115>Two dimensional array of numbers.
Elements are of type Vector[number] separated by comma and enclosed inside square [ ] brackets 
All elements must have the same length.
null represents empty value. e.g. [[1,10,5], [1,2.6,3.5], [1,2,3], [110,250,750.66]]</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <rdfs:isDefinedBy rdf:resource="http://semanticlookup.zbmed.de/km/fskxo"/>
